# INVWINEI.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: DEL on every
# row of the item list stopped at a refusal past the row a byte counts,
# on the seed's three items and the 300 of INVWIN_WINSEEDEI, item 300
# installed in item 270 (TEST/KEYS/ALLKID.REQ).  DEL with all 303
# chosen, Yes, deletes items 1 to 269 and stops at item 270, which has
# a part: the failure's box says 269 of 303, and the list, fetched
# again once, counts the 34 left, more than its window shows, its
# focus row alone chosen.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEI.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH DEL Y
S DELSTOP
K ENTER
S DELHALT
K ALT-F X
